"\n"
"If lazy loading is enabled, data is only constructed and validated on first "
"read access. If not, validation is done\n"
"when setting the item."
msgstr ""

#: /home/cedric/Nextcloud/Devel/python/python-ngoschema/ngoschema/protocols/__init__.py:3
msgid ""
"ObjectProtocol is class defined by a json-schema and built by TypeBuilder."
"build_object_protocol.\n"
"The schema is specified directly by a protected attribute _schema or by "
"providing its id using a protected\n"
"attribute _id to be resolved in loaded schemas.\n"
"\n"
"The class is built with an ordered dictionary of property types (which can "
"be Literal or a subclass of\n"
"ObjectProtocol or ArrayProtocol.\n"
"\n"
"An instance behave as a standard mapping, but its properties can also be "
"accessed through a\n"
"descriptor (renamed using clean_js_name in case it contains forbidden "
"characters in python arguments).\n"
"When _attributeByName is enabled, attributes can be accessed also by their "
"names according to setting ATTRIBUTE_NAME_FIELD\n"
"\n"
"If lazy loading is enabled, data is only constructed and validated on first "
"read access. If not, validation is done\n"
"when setting the item."
msgstr ""

